    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean you say \"proponents argue\" but like, isn't it pretty much a fact that high density is just better for the environment and transit? it seems like the single family thing is mostly just people trying to keep their property values up at the expense of everyone else. isn't that way more of an outdated way of thinking?",
